  "premium.introAdmin": "Mahhala vs Premium matrix yalolu hlelo lokusebenza. Hlela ukuthi yikuphi okungeziwe Okumahhala noma I-Premium ku-Admin → I-Premium. I-akhawunti yakho yomqondisi isivele ihlanganisa i-Premium.",
